{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\" datamodel=\"ecmascript\" initial=\"a\">\n  <state id=\"a\"><onentry><if cond=\" \"><log expr=\"1\"/></if></onentry><transition event=\"go\" target=\"f\"/></state><final id=\"f\"/>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/lint009-empty-if-condition.scx"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":0,"notes":0,"total":1,"warnings":1},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"level":"warning","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/lint009-empty-if-condition.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":38,"endLine":2,"startColumn":30,"startLine":2}}}],"message":{"markdown":"empty `cond` on `<if>` is still evaluated and cannot produce a value\n\n**Note:** an attribute that is present is evaluated even when empty; an empty expression raises `error.execution` instead of behaving as if the attribute were absent\n\n**Help:** write the condition this `<if>` branch tests; `cond` is required on `<if>`, so a last branch that always runs is written as `<else/>`\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §5.10 Errors\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §5.9 Expressions","text":"empty `cond` on `<if>` is still evaluated and cannot produce a value"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":134,"start":126},"category":"lint"},"ruleId":"LINT009"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"warning"},"fullDescription":{"text":"a blank `<log expr>` is treated as absent (the log has no value), while every other empty expression attribute, including `<transition cond>`, is still evaluated as an invalid expression and raises `error.execution` (a condition is then false); either way the empty value is almost always a mistake"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: write the intended expression, or remove the attribute.\n\nSpecification: SCXML 1.0 §5.9 Expressions\n\nRun `scx --explain LINT009` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/#expressions","id":"LINT009","name":"LINT009","properties":{"category":"lint"},"shortDescription":{"text":"an expression attribute is present but empty"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}